<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Transports</title>

<style>
body {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    background: #eef1f5;
    color: #1a1a1a;
}

.header {
    background: #0d2a4a;
    color: white;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 20px;
}

.header h1 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 24px;
}

.header p {
    margin: 5px 0;
    font-size: 13px;
}

.nav {
    background: #123a66;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
}

.nav a {
    color: white;
    padding: 12px 18px;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: bold;
    font-size: 14px;
}

.nav a:hover {
    background: #0b2542;
}

.container {
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 20px auto;
    padding: 10px;
}

.section {
    background: white;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    border-radius: 5px;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
}

.section-header {
    background: #0d2a4a;
    color: white;
    padding: 12px 15px;
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: bold;
}

.section-content {
    padding: 15px;
}

.transport-box {
    background: #f7f9fc;
    border-left: 5px solid #0d2a4a;
    padding: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
}

.notice {
    background: #f0f2f5;
    padding: 12px;
    font-size: 13px;
    border-left: 4px solid #999;
    margin-top: 10px;
}

.footer {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 15px;
    background: #0d2a4a;
    color: white;
    font-size: 12px;
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="header">
    <h1>Oklahoma County Detention Center©</h1>
    <p>Pretrial Transport Coordination Division</p>
    <p>201 N. Shartel Ave, Oklahoma City, OK 73102</p>
</div>

<div class="nav">
    <a href="index.html">Home</a>
    <a href="programs.html">Programs</a>
    <a href="case.html">Cases</a>
    <a href="transport.html">Transports</a>
    <a href="payments.html">Payments</a>
    <a href="contact.html">Contacts</a>
    <a href="agreements.html">Agreements</a>
</div>

<div class="container">

    <!-- PAGE TITLE -->
    <div class="section">
        <div class="section-header">Transports</div>
        <div class="section-content">
            <p>Post-Release Transportation Measures & Coordination Procedures</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- OVERVIEW -->
    <div class="section">
        <div class="section-header">Transport Overview</div>
        <div class="section-content">
            <p>
                Post-release transportation services are coordinated to ensure safe,
                compliant, and verifiable movement of individuals from detention
                facilities to designated residential, treatment, or supervision locations.
            </p>

            <div class="notice">
                All transport arrangements are assigned based on custody level, travel distance,
                and supervision requirements determined by pretrial services.
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- TRANSPORT TYPES -->
    <div class="section">
        <div class="section-header">Authorized Transport Methods</div>
        <div class="section-content">

            <div class="transport-box">
                <strong>Standard Ground Transport</strong><br>
                Local or in-state vehicle transfer coordinated by certified personnel.<br>
                <strong>Estimated Cost:</strong> $125.00 – $450.00
            </div>

            <div class="transport-box">
                <strong>Extended Ground Transfer</strong><br>
                Multi-county or cross-state supervised transport with scheduled stops.<br>
                <strong>Estimated Cost:</strong> $450.00 – $1,200.00
            </div>

            <div class="transport-box">
                <strong>Commercial Flight Coordination</strong><br>
                Airline-based transport with itinerary monitoring and verification.<br>
                <strong>Estimated Cost:</strong> $850.00 – $3,500.00
            </div>

            <div class="transport-box">
                <strong>Secured Escort Transport</strong><br>
                High-risk supervised escort with continuous monitoring and custody control.<br>
                <strong>Estimated Cost:</strong> $1,500.00 – $5,800.00
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- PROCEDURES -->
    <div class="section">
        <div class="section-header">Transport Procedures</div>
        <div class="section-content">

            <div>• Identity verification prior to release</div>
            <div>• Assignment of approved transport method</div>
            <div>• Scheduling of departure and arrival times</div>
            <div>• Continuous monitoring (if applicable)</div>
            <div>• Arrival confirmation and documentation logging</div>

        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- COST FACTORS -->
    <div class="section">
        <div class="section-header">Cost Determination Factors</div>
        <div class="section-content">

            <div>• Distance and travel duration</div>
            <div>• Level of supervision required</div>
            <div>• Mode of transportation</div>
            <div>• Risk classification of individual</div>
            <div>• Scheduling urgency</div>

        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- NOTICE -->
    <div class="section">
        <div class="section-header">Official Notice</div>
        <div class="section-content">

            <div class="notice">
                Transport assignments and costs are determined by pretrial services and
                are subject to change based on operational requirements. All transport
                activity must comply with assigned supervision conditions and reporting protocols.
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>

</div>

<div class="footer">
    © 2026 Oklahoma County Pretrial Services | Official Use Only
</div>

</body>
</html>
